  "content": "<html><body>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>Super RPG 字体</strong></span></p> \n <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">描述</span></strong></p> \n <p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">您的原版体验将进一步提升，因为这款现代且独特的顺滑易读字体。<a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 专用，但现在面向大众开放！</span></p> \n <p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">基于流行的 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Russo One\" rel=\"nofollow\">Russo One</a> 谷歌字体，由 Jovanny Lemonad 设计。</span></p> \n <p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">该字体根据开放字体许可证（Open Font License）发布。</span><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/585/634/russo-one-font-character-map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1150\"><br></p> \n <p>&nbsp;</p> \n <p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>截图（来自 DarkRPG）</strong></span></p> \n <p>&nbsp;</p> \n <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/413/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p> \n <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/414/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p> \n <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/412/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p> \n <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/415/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p> \n <p>&nbsp;</p> \n <p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就获得一个服务器，与朋友们一起游玩！点击 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a> 或下方横幅，并使用代码 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享受 25% 的折扣！</span></p> \n <p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p> \n <p>&nbsp;</p> \n <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p> \n <p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p> \n</body></html>",
